{"version":1,"content":"<p>Anthropic於美東時間周四登陸美股，本次IPO合計募資813億美元，其中19.5億美元由七位創始人出售股份所得。正如此前報道，每位創始人拿出約340萬股在本次IPO中發售。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587272.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:01.981348+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:03:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.071320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.071320+00:00","content_hash":"c9d363c4d28b9656fc38056ea385c6e841d8858618430deca3f5322744df6fe0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}